sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Shell as Channel shell
  participant Host as Tauri MCP host
  participant Server as MCP server
  participant Proxy as Trusted outer proxy
  participant App as Opaque-origin app
  participant Relay as Buzz relay

  rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
    Note over User,Server: Install and consent
    User->>Shell: Enter MCP endpoint
    Shell->>Host: Connect
    Host->>Server: tools/list
    Server-->>Host: App tool and resource URI
    Host->>Server: resources/read
    Server-->>Host: HTML and resource policy
    Host->>Host: Pin endpoint and sanitize Content Security Policy (CSP)
    Host-->>Shell: Sanitized domains and requested permissions
    Shell-->>User: Show install review
    User->>Shell: Add channel tab
    Shell->>Shell: Store approved policy envelope
  end

  rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
    Note over Shell,App: Open the tab
    Shell->>Host: Prepare app with approved policy
    Host->>Server: resources/read
    Server-->>Host: Current HTML and policy
    Host->>Host: Confirm current policy is a subset of approved policy
    Host-->>Proxy: Register CSP-bound view
    Proxy-->>App: Load HTML with allow-scripts
    Note over Proxy,App: The inner iframe has an opaque origin.<br/>The app does not receive Buzz credentials.
  end

  rect rgb(255, 247, 237)
    Note over Shell,Server: Runtime interaction
    App->>Shell: Validated postMessage
    alt MCP tool call
      Shell->>Host: tools/call as app
      Host->>Server: tools/call
      Server-->>Host: Tool result
      Host-->>Shell: Tool result
      Shell-->>App: Tool result through the bridge
    else Channel post request
      Shell-->>User: Show exact attributed message
      User->>Shell: Approve post
      Shell->>Relay: Publish with the Buzz signer
      Note over Shell,Relay: The Nostr signing key stays in Buzz.
    end
  end
